`≤ (2 Kc + 5)(W+1)(V+1) K^τ`. Hence (**`cLayIn_le`**, **`cLayOut_le`**)
`cost ≤ (4·10^5 + 2 Kc + 5) (W+1) (V+1) ((D+1) K + p K^{τ-1})` whenever `D q K ≤ p`.
